      "created_at": "2014-09-02T14:55:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>From they way they&nbsp;have been talking, I&nbsp;think&nbsp;that once they have finished Sentinels of the Multiverse, that they will be finished producing games for it. They do already have the continueing story in Sentinel Tactics, taking place roughly a decade after Sentinels of the Multiverse's story has ended.</p>",
