      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-02T14:59:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The plan is to make different games.</p><p>Sentinels Tactics is set in the same Multiverse, continuing from where the card game will leave off and they are hopeful that it will also have a good run.</p><p>If that is successful there will be more games continuing the saga of Sentinels Tactics, but at the end of the card game there will no longer be anymore card game expansions, or a new storyline with the same card game mechanics.</p><p>However there is a pretty good fan community that is already making their own expansions, so hopefully that will continue.</p>",
