      "created_at": "2014-09-02T15:32:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm still holding out hope against all odds for more. &nbsp;A quote from Paul in the comments on the preorder page addressing promo reprints:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>\"<span>Actually, all of our promo cards will eventually be printed in an \"unlimited edition\" promo card pack once the <strong>MAIN</strong> story arc of Sentinels of the Multiverse is complete in around two years.\" &nbsp;(emphasis mine)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Maybe some kind of side story concurrent with the main. &nbsp;Just wild speculation trying to keep my hopes alive.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
