      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"robbritt\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/b487fb/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> robbritt:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Once the current storyline ends, will GTG stop making SotM in its current form? Or will they start another arc? Some of this info may not have been released yet, so the whole plan may not be known. Could someone summarize what is known about GTG's plans about after \"The End\"?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Sadly there is a \"limit\" on the current form.&nbsp; More then that, Christopher has said in the recent House Rules podcast that he will be personally travelling across the country to throw away all copies of SotM once the story ends.&nbsp; Or maybe I misheard him. :-).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ben</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Edited for proper attribution to the mighty Creator *</li>\n</ul>",
