      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/u/53a042/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-09-03T00:16:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As much as I enjoy SOTM, it has certain limits as a game.&nbsp; I hope that when it wraps up, we will eventually get a new game which is similar, but adds additional depth in certain key areas (EG giving incapacitated players a more meaningful play-option than saying \"okay, you get to do whatever benefits us the most\") - SOTM 2.0, as it were, or a game with similarly clean mechanics but a whole new setting.</p>",
