      "created_at": "2014-09-03T02:42:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know that it is a common trope in comic books (at least in the past 10 years), but I am not/looking forward to the inevitable \"Civil War\" that may happen in ST. &nbsp;My hope is that like the \"evil Justice League\" that met the regular Justice League, Iron Legacy was just the first of an alternate FF which I will dub the Iron Five. &nbsp;I hope that there is never a rift in the FF, but if there is, it will be one heck of a story.</p>",
