      "created_at": "2014-09-03T23:06:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The multiverse for me has always been about the stories that are created. &nbsp;For example one person could see Baron Blade as a cakewalk where they defeated him handily; while another person encountered Baron Blade and was crushed in defeat. &nbsp;I do believe there is a \"canon story,\" but I also don't think that the \"end of the multiverse\" means the improbability of something major like \"Civil War\" being an impossibility. &nbsp;If it does, that is why we have a fanfiction section.</p>",
